            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The development and validation of new endodontic surgical procedures, equipment, instruments, and materials have triggered a large increase in the perceived value of this treatment option. In this section, we provide an analysis of the clinical studies evaluating the outcomes of endodontic surgical procedures.</AbstractText>
